se into the formula for the curvature, we get the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}κ(t) & =\\frac{|2{e}^{t}\\cdot 4{e}^{2t}-2{e}^{2t}\\cdot 2{e}^{t}|}{{((2{e}^{t})^{2}+(2{e}^{2t})^{2})}^{3/2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4{e}^{3t}}{{(4{e}^{2t}+4{e}^{4t})}^{3/2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2{(1+{e}^{2t})}^{3/2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the curvature at $t=0$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}κ(0) & =\\frac{1}{2{(1+{e}^{2(0)})}^{3/2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2{(1+1)}^{3/2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4\\sqrt{2}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the radius of curvature at $t=0$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}R(0) & =\\frac{1}{κ(0)}=4\\sqrt{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535673 true] [17592186360526 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360527 13194139535673 true] [17592186360526 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360528 13194139535673 true] [17592186360526 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360529 13194139535673 true] [17592186360526 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360530 13194139535673 true] [17592186360526 1000 #edb/ref 17592186360531 13194139535673 true] [17592186360526 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535673 true] [17592186360526 1041 "selection" 13194139535673 true] [17592186360526 1104 #edb/ref 17592186360527 13194139535673 true] [17592186360526 1110 #uuid "2b2edb53-5676-5944-8e6f-a77440c922d1" 13194139535673 true] [17592186360527 1034 "4\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535673 true] [17592186360527 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535673 true] [17592186360527 1111 #uuid "a79277aa-cbb1-57a1-82d5-8f0b893e94cc" 13194139535673 true] [17592186360528 1034 "\\sqrt{2}" 13194139535673 true] [17592186360528 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535673 true] [17592186360528 1111 #uuid "c112bad1-a558-5110-8023-22629abc9616" 13194139535673 true] [17592186360529 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{8}" 13194139535673 true] [17592186360529 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535673 true] [17592186360529 1111 #uuid "53a23580-64aa-5fd0-bf2a-81839395371c" 13194139535673 true] [17592186360530 1034 "8" 13194139535673 true] [17592186360530 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535673 true] [1